<title>USA: Cross-Continent buys two Toyota dealerships.</title>
<headline>Cross-Continent buys two Toyota dealerships.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO, Texas 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cross-Continent Auto Retailers Inc said Friday it had completed its previously announced deal to acquire two Toyota dealerships, in Thornton, Colo., and Las Vegas.</p>
<p>The deal was valued at $40 million, including $28 million cash, $7 million in promissory notes, and $5 million in Cross-Continent common stock.</p>
<p>The transaction will be accounted for as a purchase, Cross-Continent said.</p>
</text>
